  <reason>Subject and account: The subject of this report is Nimra Qadir, holder of account PK**MEZN****9210, opened on 9 January 2021. The customer's declared occupation is medical sales officer (salaried), with a declared income of PKR 150,000 per month.

Activity summary: During the period 2 May 2026 to 30 May 2026, the account recorded 16 credits totalling PKR 24,648,000 as well as 6 debits totalling PKR 22,647,000. The credits included 15 cash deposits totalling PKR 24,498,000, made over the counter at 4 branches (Clifton Branch, DHA Phase 6 Branch, Gulshan-e-Iqbal Branch, Saddar Branch). The activity was detected on 30 May 2026, when Tazama typology STR-PK-01 scored 320 against an alert threshold of 300.

Grounds for suspicion: 13 of 15 cash deposits (87%) were between PKR 1,600,000 and PKR 1,999,999, totalling PKR 22,952,000, just below the cash transaction reporting threshold of PKR 2,000,000. The cash was deposited across 4 branches (Clifton Branch, DHA Phase 6 Branch, Gulshan-e-Iqbal Branch, Saddar Branch) rather than at a single branch. The customer made more than one cash deposit on 1 day (22 May 2026). Credits in the activity window were 164.3 times the declared monthly income, against a declared income of PKR 150,000 per month. Taken together, these indicators are consistent with suspected structuring; the reporting entity has not established the underlying offence.

Flow of funds: Of the outgoing funds, PKR 11,807,000 was sent to Sheraz Traders (PK**SHER****1518, Synthetic Bank A) in 3 transactions. Of the outgoing funds, PKR 10,840,000 was sent to Crescent Imports (PK**CRES****1592, Synthetic Bank C) in 3 transactions. Funds did not remain in the account: debits equal to 92% of credits, with a median of 28.1 hours between the latest credit and each debit.

Other considerations: Screening of the subject returned no match on sanctions, PEP or adverse-media screening on 28 May 2026.

Action taken by the reporting entity: Action taken: a note by L2 analyst (28 May 2026): "Account placed under enhanced monitoring pending the reporting decision. No contact made with the customer about this review."</reason>
